## Session 9: Novel Techniques from Research (claude95-claude98)
=============================================================

### Research Phase
Searched for 2025-2026 MLIR matmul optimization techniques. Key findings:
- "Library Liberation" (C4ML 2026): Intel achieving competitive MKL via compiler nanokernels
- TPP-MLIR achieving >90% of hand-written code for FP32, within 5% for f64
- No new MLIR passes available to solve malloc-in-forall issue
