6. **hoist_redundant_vector_transfers**: Neutral — general LICM already handles these cases
7. **optimize-allocation-liveness**: Neutral for matmul_2 — alloca already has optimal liveness
8. **use-aligned-alloc**: Neutral for matmul_2 — alloca already uses alignment=64 attribute
9. **Combined passes hurt**: Adding arith-unsigned+int-range to flatten+mem2reg makes performance worse (1.45x vs 1.43x), confirming matmul_1 extreme pipeline sensitivity

