=== Session 30: Novel Approaches ===
Resuming matmul_2 optimization with fundamentally new strategies:
- C output promotion (eliminate store/reload between K-blocks via alias-free alloca)
- Affine loop lowering (convert-linalg-to-affine-loops + affine optimizations)
- MLIR 21.1.8 features (hoist_redundant_vector_transfers, etc.)

Key insight: assembly analysis shows C accumulators (ymm0-7) are stored/reloaded between
each unrolled K=4 block because LLVM cannot prove C output (%arg2) doesn't alias with
promoted A/B panel loads. Promoting C into a separate alloca could break this alias chain.

